    "traits": "Consumable Incense",
    "description": "<strong>Usage burned in a censer; Activate Interact (2 AP).</strong>\n\nA calming mixture of lavender, myrrh and several mild sedative herbs traditionally used during funerals and vigils. A creature that spends at least 10 minutes resting in the smoke gains a +1-item bonus to its next saving throw against a Fear or Emotion effect attempted within the following hour. A creature may benefit from Mourner's Incense only once per day.\n\nOn the sheet: A creature may benefit from Mourner's Incense only once per day.\n\nPillars of Faith, Chapter 6.",
